  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint (+2), moderate (+4), or strong (+6) Enhancement; <strong>CL</strong> 4th (+2), 8th (+4), or 12th (+6)<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> headband; <strong>Price</strong> 4,000 (+2), 16,000 (+4), 36,000 (+6); <strong>Weight</strong> 2 lbs.</p>\n<p>This headband tends to help its users look calm and wise. While worn, it grants a +2/+4/+6 enhancement bonus to Wisdom. Treat this as a temporary ability bonus for the first 24 hours the headband is worn.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Enhancement sphere (Mental Enhancement (enhance)); <strong>Cost</strong> 2,000 gp (+2), 8,000 gp (+4), or 18,000 gp (+6)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
